OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start in the east but
OL,6,Frain in the west will spread east
OL,7,Fduring the morning. Rain will turn
OL,8,Flight and patchy in the afternoon.
OL,9,FDrier in the west later, quite a
OL,10,Fbreezy day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome clear spells developing
OL,13,Fas cloud breaks but still a few
OL,14,Fshowers moving across the province in
OL,15,Fthe fresh westerly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA few showers to start the
OL,18,Fday in the north, a lot of dry and
OL,19,Fbright weather around with Autumn
OL,20,Fsunshine, winds easing and a pleasant
OL,21,Fend to the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
