OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,6,Fbright on Sunday with light winds,
OL,7,Fclouding over later as some rain moves
OL,8,Fin overnight. Cloudy at first on
OL,9,FMonday but brightening up for the new
OL,10,Fweek
